This paper was printed as Algebra, Analysis and Differential Equations I and was shared by mathematics and mathematics and statistics. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_papers_2/response/1850333/attach/3/FOI%2020210708%201%20Data.zip?cookie_passthrough=1[released examination archive], member `FOI-20210708-1 - Data/4301 (1).pdf`, pages 1–4. The examination took place on 18 June 2012. No mark allocations are printed. The solutions cover all nine questions.

